BulletSharp.Double
==================

This repository is a modified, derivative version of BulletSharpPInvoke
(the C# wrapper) and libbulletc (its native glue layer) by Andres Traks,
which in turn wraps the Bullet Physics Library (bullet3) by Erwin Coumans
and contributors. All three are licensed under the zlib license. The
modifications in this repository (namespace restructuring, double-precision
ABI fixes, project layout, and ongoing work) are themselves licensed under
the same zlib license.

